  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Les Fruits Tillou Pineapple Processing Expansion Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Pineapple processing..Beneficiaries: 60 employees (40 women) and over 300 suppliers..Description: The grant will enable the business to expand its processing capacity through the acquisition of additional dryers, processing space to meet food processing norms, and increasing its ability to source raw material from producers.</narrative>
  </description>
